WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.303
A structured document separates meaning from manual formatting.

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:06.607
Styles identify headings, body text and captions consistently.

00:00:06.607 --> 00:00:16.930
A practical report becomes easier to navigate, update and export when its structure is clear instead of being simulated with repeated spaces and bold text.

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:23.152
The title may be ordinary text with manual formatting rather than a heading style.

00:00:23.152 --> 00:00:26.881
Apply the correct heading style and update the contents field.

00:00:26.881 --> 00:00:29.865
Visual size alone does not establish document structure.

00:00:30.865 --> 00:00:33.413
What should identify a report section?

00:00:33.413 --> 00:00:38.510
A heading style records structural meaning and supports navigation and contents generation.
